hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1731","**\nNarrated to us 'Abd al-Rahman ibn Bisr ibn al-Hakam who said: Al-Hajjaj narrated to us. He said: Ibn Jurayj said.\n\nAnd narrated to us Abu 'Ali al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani and a group who said: Al-Hajjaj narrated to us, from Ibn Jurayj, who informed me: Isma'il ibn Umayyah narrated to us, from Ayyub ibn Khalid, from 'Abdullah ibn Rafi' the freed slave of Umm Salamah, from Abu Hurayrah (RA) who said:\n\nThe Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) took me by the hand and said, \Indeed Allah created the earth on Saturday"," and created the mountains in it on Sunday"," and created the trees on Monday"," and created the disliked things on Tuesday"," and created the light on Wednesday"," and dispersed the creatures in it on Thursday"," and created Adam after the 'Asr of Friday"," at the last creation in the last hour of the hours of Friday"," between the 'Asr and the night.\"""""
